す\n\n資料↓\nhttps://yuki2ykt.wixsite.com/yukimino1020yt/character-miu\n\n参考イラスト(R-18注意)↓\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/124290112\n\nよろしくおねがいします (*˘ ˘*)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Komepan_pan/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/27a6200d/uploads/outputs/43918f76-59c5-47b5-b035-7846c2026707?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c0d9445083895dcfefe7fe8d33627d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27a6200d/uploads/outputs/43918f76-59c5-47b5-b035-7846c2026707?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c0d9445083895dcfefe7fe8d33627d9, https://si.imgix.net/27a6200d/uploads/outputs/43918f76-59c5-47b5-b035-7846c2026707?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a52bf4d67f66612d1086ddfd073d1a60 2x, https://si.imgix.net/27a6200d/uploads/outputs/43918f76-59c5-47b5-b035-7846c2026707?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9837982866a273fe2fa9a119bc7dcf6 3x", "genre": "video", "nsfw": false, "body": "私の猫を描いてくれませんか？恥ずかしそうな表情で描いてくれませんか？最初は、見る人を見ていないのですが、そのうち気づいて照れるような！！あなたは最高です！！ありがとうございます！！！！！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gHSbHklcRZSvDj0K4uWRvggt2QqGXsbA?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gHSbHklcRZSvDj0K4uWRvggt2QqGXsbA?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Komepan_pan/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81087137/uploads/origins/f50ddb07-bb12-46ee-9d16-fb1a387fbdbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ea867d3d8a0c4dc81be08178bc6ae2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/81087137/uploads/origins/f50ddb07-bb12-46ee-9d16-fb1a387fbdbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ea867d3d8a0c4dc81be08178bc6ae2a, https://si.imgix.net/81087137/uploads/origins/f50ddb07-bb12-46ee-9d16-fb1a387fbdbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=279f758333d1a